        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"575fe208-3271-4094-8ba4-47a326c6856b\",\"review_text\":\"It's time wasting app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fcda57bd-2592-46a2-8d3c-8d356c773fbc\",\"review_text\":\"Gooooooood\"},{\"review_id\":\"48a33ded-2772-485b-9402-9e27b6c2054c\",\"review_text\":\"^This is the proper way to have a pay wall system. Great app and doesn't have any problems. Still using it after all these years. Absolutely would recommend\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa791efe-d3a1-4bdc-93e1-4e22b4d7ffdf\",\"review_text\":\"Freedom ratpack Joe Rogan, Matt Walsh, Ben Shapiro, Elon musk, Jordan Peterson.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae1347b2-d0ce-48d9-9f38-144cde8db30e\",\"review_text\":\"Very amazing app. Huge collection of music to offer. But unfortunately doesn't works on Airtel WiFi. I don't know what is the issue but works for mobile data. Only doesn't works for airtel wifi. Not only at my place but many places i have observed this\"},{\"review_id\":\"6367447c-61cb-46d6-95b8-789cec205d5d\",\"review_text\":\"This varrry intrasting app I love it soo much ❤️❤️❤️❤️💓💓💓I so much like it💜❤️💓\"},{\"review_id\":\"4215cb8f-dc3b-42df-8d73-8fb574dfe60a\",\"review_text\":\"Bad app\"},{\"review_id\":\"977d5ae3-6adc-4d54-8f0e-a2cb7c6ca148\",\"review_text\":\"Hated\"},{\"review_id\":\"13c1b10b-b7b5-4ae8-b069-078a8b40cfae\",\"review_text\":\"Great\"},{\"review_id\":\"1035abf5-e730-4426-a9e4-b68e05dfcd3b\",\"review_text\":\"First, it showed listen this 'ad' and get 30 minutes of 'ad free' music , after when I played one song, they gave 2 ads of 30secs.\"}]}"
